        "Label": "CORRECTION",
        "content": "After publication of the article [1], it has been brought to our attention that there is an acknowledgement missing. The authors would like to add the following - \"The authors would like to thank the staff and community partners who work to implement the activities of the community wide campaign. In particular we would like to thank Lisa Mitchell-Bennett, Vanessa Saldana, Jennifer Mota, Sister Phylis Peters and the team of community health workers at UT Health and Proyecto Juan Diego who were involved in planning and gathering data.\""
